2) TITLE SUPPORT
If a title review was requested, decide whether the requested section
changes support changing the title to the proposed title. Supporting changes
show a real shift in duties, scope, or requirements that the proposed title
reflects. Wording cleanups or minor additions do not count.
[INSERT TITLE SUPPORT CRITERIA]
- title_supported: true or false.
- title_support_feedback: if false, two or three friendly sentences to the
  manager explaining what's missing and which sections would need to change
  to support the new title. If true, leave empty.
- title_support_assessment: two or three neutral sentences for HR on the
  strength of the support either way.
If no title review was requested, set title_supported to true and leave the
other two fields empty.
